# Course games monorepo

This repository hosts multiple student games under separate folders.

## Structure

```
course-games/
  index.html           # empty root — NO game list, NO navigation
  shared/              # shared CSS (footer, etc.)
  fix-wiring/          # game 1 — self-contained (index.html, css/, js/, assets/)
  l2-.../              # future games
```

## Rules

- **Never** add a central menu linking all games on the root or shared pages.
- Each game folder is self-contained with relative asset paths.
- Student access: **direct URL only** (`/fix-wiring/`, `/l2-slug/`).
- Use non-obvious folder slugs for new games when privacy matters.
- Always include author footer per `author-footer.mdc`.

## New game

Copy `fix-wiring/` folder, rename, customize. Do not link it from root `index.html`.
